  "title": "Applesauce Custard Pie",
  "description": "Simple and delicious, this recipe makes this pie just a bit different from traditional apple pie. Applesauce, eggs, sugar, butter and vanilla are stirred up and poured into an unbaked pie shell. A bit of nutmeg is sprinkled on the top and it 's baked until the custard is set.",
  "authors": [
